	(text "Pinout corrected to match standard JST 6-pin motor+encoder cable \n(pins 1/6 swapped for motor polarity, pins 2/5 swapped for encoder \nVCC/GND). Firmware forward/backward negation workaround should be \nremoved once this hardware revision is in use."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 243.078 39.37 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "bfa0edc3-98ab-4857-a1a7-6c2c97fb5675")
	)
	(text "I_Lim = 512mA @ 0.39 Ohms\nAdd another 0.39 Ohm in \nparallel for I_Lim = 1.024A.\nNeeds to dissapate I_rms^2 * R\n0.7*0.4 = 0.2W in total, \nso two 1/4W in parallel ok.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 21.59 77.47 0)
